        "source": "def investigate(context, acquire):\n    values = context[\"values\"]\n    n = len(values)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    best = None\n    best_err = None\n    for a in (-2, -1, 0, 1, 2):\n        for b in (-2, -1, 0, 1, 2):\n            for c in (-2, -1, 0, 1, 2):\n                for g in (-2, -1, 1, 2):\n                    for mode in (0, 1):\n                        for passes in (1, 2, 3, 4):\n                            contrib = []\n                            for i in range(n):\n                                x = values[i]\n                                p = a * x + b * x * x + c * x * x * x\n                                if mode == 0:\n                                    prev = values[i - 1] if i > 0 else 0\n                                else:\n                                    prev = sum(values[:i])\n                                contrib.append(p + g * x * prev)\n                            arr = contrib\n                            for _ in range(passes):\n                                acc = 0\n                                nxt = []\n                                for v in arr:\n                                    acc = acc + v\n                                    nxt.append(acc)\n                                arr = nxt\n                            val = arr[-1]\n                            err = 0\n                            for i in range(n):\n                                err = err + abs(contrib[i])\n                            if best is None or err < best_err:\n                                best_err = err\n                                best = val\n    return best\n",
        "scope": "Enumerates the full private hypothesis family: cubic p(x)=a*x+b*x^2+c*x^3 with a,b,c in {-2..2}, optional g*x times previous value or prefix sum with g in {-2,-1,1,2}, and 1..4 cumulative-sum passes. Selects the candidate whose contribution magnitudes are smallest, then returns the last entry after passes.",
